%% WeaveNYC — P2P Sync Flow Sequence Diagram
%% Source: 07_P2P_Node_Design.md §5-6 + 08_Data_Model.md §1

sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Edge Node<br/>(PWA WebWorker)
    participant A as Anchor Node<br/>(libp2p Full Node)
    participant IPFS as Helia / IPFS<br/>(Content-Addressed)
    participant C as Cloud<br/>(PostgreSQL Index)

    Note over E,C: === 1. Edge Bootstrap and Node Discovery ===

    E->>E: Generate Ed25519 key pair<br/>(per community, stored in IndexedDB)
    E->>A: WebSocket connect<br/>libp2p Identify handshake
    A-->>E: Return bootstrap node list
    E->>A: Subscribe GossipSub topics<br/>weavenyc/{community_id}/posts<br/>weavenyc/{community_id}/announcements

    Note over E,C: === 2. User Posts -> P2P Sync ===

    E->>E: Create Post locally<br/>Store in IndexedDB
    E->>E: Build PostSummaryDAG<br/>{ post_id, post_type, category,<br/>title_hash, location_zip,<br/>community_id, sig }

    alt User opts in to sync
        E->>A: GossipSub publish<br/>topic: weavenyc/{community_id}/posts<br/>event: post.published
        A->>A: Verify signature (Ed25519)<br/>+ Rule engine check
        A->>IPFS: Helia Pin<br/>Store PostSummaryDAG
        IPFS-->>A: CID (content hash)
        A->>C: REST API write to PostgreSQL<br/>post record + ipfs_cid
        C-->>A: OK
    else Local only
        E->>E: Keep in IndexedDB<br/>Do not sync to network
    end

    Note over E,C: === 3. Other Edges Receive Updates ===

    A->>E: GossipSub broadcast<br/>post.published event
    E->>E: Verify signature<br/>Update local post_cache
    E->>IPFS: Fetch full DAG on demand<br/>(via CID)
    IPFS-->>E: PostSummaryDAG content

    Note over E,C: === 4. Offline Recovery Sync ===

    E->>E: Detect reconnection
    E->>A: Request events after last_sync_ts
    A-->>E: Incremental event list
    E->>E: Batch update IndexedDB
